  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Central Continent forces ambush Song Zi Xing in True Yang mountain range, he recognizes the trap as Illusion Garden and sees that the ten great ancient sects have joined the hunt under Heavenly Court orders.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "loc_true_yang_mountain_range",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Two rank seven Gu Immortals from Heavenly Lotus Sect control the house in secret while other immortals fight in the open.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The house is already set when Song Zi Xing tries to flee, so the ambushers treat escape as only a matter of time once the long setup is finished. Mobilizing a complete Immortal Gu House like Illusion Garden costs far more immortal essence than incomplete Profound Ice House, and even rank seven Gu Immortals cannot sustain it for long. Song Zi Xing’s violent blood dragon bat, an ancient desolate beast with rank seven battle strength, crashes into Illusion Garden from outside and self-detonates together with his internal attack, cracking the house so he can escape.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_profound_ice_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Illusion Garden is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile once fielded, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yu Mu Chun names Illusion Garden as Heavenly Lotus Sect’s Immortal Gu House, built on illusion path over three hundred years earlier by Illusion Demon Immortal Huang Xiao. He also says Illusion Demon Immortal has already died, and that the stealth of the current trap implies a high-cultivation controller. Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord, Bi Chen Tian, and Lian Jiu Sheng control Illusion Garden together, combining three rank eights to trap immortal zombie Bo Qing and Yu Mu Chun inside layers of illusion that reform after sword light exposes the true scene.",
      "chapters": [
        963
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
